# Предложения
## Список предложений
GET http://localhost:4000/offers HTTP/1.1

###

## Создать предложение

POST http://localhost:4000/offers HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Wood and stone place",
  "description": "A quiet cozy and picturesque place.",
  "postDate": "2026-04-13T14:30:00.000Z",
  "city": "Paris",
  "previewImage": "preview.jpg",
  "images": ["image1.jpg", "image2.jpg"],
  "isPremium": true,
  "isFavorite": false,
  "rating": 4.5,
  "type": "apartment",
  "bedrooms": 2,
  "maxAdults": 4,
  "price": 120,
  "goods": ["Breakfast", "Wi-Fi"],
  "userId": "6a0ba82cebee1e24f57fce39",
  "location": {
    "latitude": 48.85661,
    "longitude": 2.351499
  }
}

###

## Информация о предложении
# offerId — id из ответа POST /offers

GET http://localhost:4000/offers/6a1de03e3767260a14051049 HTTP/1.1

